38371>>>
38371>>>    Procedure OnNavigateForward tWebNavigateData NavigateData Integer hoInvokingView Integer hoInvokingObject
38374>>>        WebSet pbRender of oNewButton to True
38375>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to True
38376>>>
38376>>>        Case Begin
38376>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromParent)
38378>>>                // If from parent, this is a constrained drill down
38378>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
38378>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
38379>>>                Case Break
38380>>>
38380>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromChild)
38383>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent lookup from a Zoom
38383>>>                Case Break
38384>>>
38384>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromMain)
38387>>>                // If from main, this is a probably a main-file lookup from a Zoom
38387>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
38388>>>                Case Break
38389>>>
38389>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38389>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
38389>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
38389>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
38390>>>
38390>>>        Case End
38390>>>
38390>>>    End_Procedure
38391>>>
38391>>>
38391>>>End_Object 
